### 15) Driver reject a booking (offer second trip then book it for reject test)
# Note: This requires a fresh booking — use admin_booking_id if available, or skip manually.
# Rejection is tested via: POST /api/bookings/reject?bookingId=<id>
# See admin/03-admin-trip-booking-management.http for the reject flow in admin context.
